# Xcode
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
DerivedData/

# The project file is generated from project.yml but is committed, so that opening the
# repository in Xcode works without installing anything first. Its per-user parts are not.
# Opening it makes Xcode write a WorkspaceSettings and a checks plist into the workspace's
# shared data; XcodeGen generates nothing in any of these, so none of it is worth sharing.
# Anchor every path: a leading *.xcworkspace/ would only match one at the repository root.
imogen.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/
imogen.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
imogen.xcodeproj/xcuserdata/
